# WP-FAR-12B-2: the PACKAGE COOK derives the far crowd's vertex animation (UE: derived data never needs the RHI -
# FSkeletalMeshLODModel is CPU data). PackageCook CookVertexAnimations builds every .skmesh x .anim on one skeleton
# GUID from SkinnedLODModel (Engine/Geometry/SkinnedLODModel.hpp, the chain the SkinnedMesh constructor uploads),
# no device created.
# Before the run: the DDC bucket DerivedDataCache/Buckets/VertexAnimation of the project is emptied (the CesiumMan x
# walk entry gone).
# Readout (editor.log): "[PackageCook] VertexAnimation CesiumMan.skmesh x clip '...' <key> derived: lowest level N
# vertices ..." and the summary "vertex animations D derived / C cached"; then at 300 m
# "[Crowd] clip '...' vertex animation <same key> derived (DDC hit)" (never "derived now") and "[Crowd] ... vat N".
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_FAR12_SkinnedCrowd.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Quality "Quality: ViewDistance High"
Когда run Build "Package Game"
Тогда cook_log the cook log names "[PackageCook] VertexAnimation CesiumMan.skmesh x clip ... derived" with the key the editor prints below; no device created by the cook
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 90
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,0,30000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,-1
Когда advance 2
Тогда far_300 at 300 m the far figures walk; log: "[Crowd] ... vertex animation <cook's key> derived (DDC hit)", vat N > 0
